                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This a Mac exclusive game on Steam.... well that's a first! :) \n\nPaul Pixel is an unusual, humorous and attractive point-and-click adventure game... It has players defending the world against an invasion of zombies. The graphics and retro music are fantastic! Paul Pixel reminds me of playing games on classic Mac computers. \n\nIt is a fun, challenging and engaging game, that is hard to put down.",
